        "text": "Placenta Accreta Medically Reviewed by Sarah Obican, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "ac952c422e2c6525e759f615496965efb0c414088365445b81fae68705fe4d66",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What Is the Placenta — and How Does It Help Your Baby Grow? Medically Reviewed by Jennifer Wu, M.D., F.A.C.O.G.",
        "text_sha256": "930619b7e2084200050b94f81d4b48ed5f20db2989fc4a4abe8ea0ab38a54908",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What Is a Retained Placenta? Medically Reviewed by Andrei Rebarber, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "56e307f30a039e8181bd33105995f79a2c101a159c120785f7b1933562d79dc2",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
